# Vercel serves this repository as static files and must run no code of its own in front of
# them. middleware.ts at the root is the local app's loopback guard: left in, Vercel deploys it
# as Routing Middleware over every address of the site. The test that imports it goes with it,
# so the build's type check still passes. tests/siteDeploy.test.ts pins both lines.
/middleware.ts
/tests/middleware.test.ts
